{"4544140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Carnholt", "steam_appid": 4544140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4949910], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/80aa8db247e12156a8a0d1f4476e24ec.avif?t=1788266449\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras_big/80aa8db247e12156a8a0d1f4476e24ec.webp?t=1788266449 width=1560 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Craft a deck of wild creatures and powerful spells, fight in tactical battles, and slay a God that refused death. <strong>Carnholt</strong> is a deckbuilding roguelike where victory comes only to those willing to bargain with ancient powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">To defeat your foes, fight with cunning and harness powerful synergies between wild creatures and ancient powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/dbdcd6549b4678e844dc33404a37cda1.poster.avif?t=1788266449\" width=1170 height=594 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/dbdcd6549b4678e844dc33404a37cda1.webm?t=1788266449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/dbdcd6549b4678e844dc33404a37cda1.mp4?t=1788266449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Encounter mysterious creatures and uncover their stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/d9a5502fb9b10d0294059d82a060d482.poster.avif?t=1788266449\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/d9a5502fb9b10d0294059d82a060d482.webm?t=1788266449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/d9a5502fb9b10d0294059d82a060d482.mp4?t=1788266449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Journey through a constantly shifting world to discover wild creatures, forgotten relics, and equipment. Strengthen your build and forge a deck capable of unleashing devastating combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/3f3d2c335ccb2dfc96f701bb8af08cc9.poster.avif?t=1788266449\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/3f3d2c335ccb2dfc96f701bb8af08cc9.webm?t=1788266449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/3f3d2c335ccb2dfc96f701bb8af08cc9.mp4?t=1788266449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/c05ee1946ced9f0039b807a94f47ada5.avif?t=1788266449\" width=1170 height=209 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each companion comes with its own deck, upgrades, and unique passive abilities that reshape the way you play. Learn their strengths, adapt your strategy and unleash their full potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/a38fcbc3d3a3230b2710cfe76595dedc.avif?t=1788266449\" width=1170 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an illustrator, <strong>Carnholt</strong> has been a passion project that allowed me to bring to life all the paintings I created over the last few years. Every art asset in the game was made by me, and I even included a few of my oil paintings. I hope you'll enjoy exploring the world I created.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maxime Minard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/80aa8db247e12156a8a0d1f4476e24ec.avif?t=1788266449\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras_big/80aa8db247e12156a8a0d1f4476e24ec.webp?t=1788266449 width=1560 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Craft a deck of wild creatures and powerful spells, fight in tactical battles, and slay a God that refused death. <strong>Carnholt</strong> is a deckbuilding roguelike where victory comes only to those willing to bargain with ancient powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">To defeat your foes, fight with cunning and harness powerful synergies between wild creatures and ancient powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/dbdcd6549b4678e844dc33404a37cda1.poster.avif?t=1788266449\" width=1170 height=594 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/dbdcd6549b4678e844dc33404a37cda1.webm?t=1788266449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/dbdcd6549b4678e844dc33404a37cda1.mp4?t=1788266449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Encounter mysterious creatures and uncover their stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/d9a5502fb9b10d0294059d82a060d482.poster.avif?t=1788266449\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/d9a5502fb9b10d0294059d82a060d482.webm?t=1788266449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/d9a5502fb9b10d0294059d82a060d482.mp4?t=1788266449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Journey through a constantly shifting world to discover wild creatures, forgotten relics, and equipment. Strengthen your build and forge a deck capable of unleashing devastating combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/3f3d2c335ccb2dfc96f701bb8af08cc9.poster.avif?t=1788266449\" width=1170 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/3f3d2c335ccb2dfc96f701bb8af08cc9.webm?t=1788266449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/3f3d2c335ccb2dfc96f701bb8af08cc9.mp4?t=1788266449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/c05ee1946ced9f0039b807a94f47ada5.avif?t=1788266449\" width=1170 height=209 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each companion comes with its own deck, upgrades, and unique passive abilities that reshape the way you play. Learn their strengths, adapt your strategy and unleash their full potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/extras/a38fcbc3d3a3230b2710cfe76595dedc.avif?t=1788266449\" width=1170 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an illustrator, <strong>Carnholt</strong> has been a passion project that allowed me to bring to life all the paintings I created over the last few years. Every art asset in the game was made by me, and I even included a few of my oil paintings. I hope you'll enjoy exploring the world I created.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maxime Minard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Craft a deck of wild creatures and powerful spells, fight in tactical battles, and slay a God that refused death. Carnholt is a deckbuilding roguelike where you must bind your soul to an ancient beast and harness the corpses of the dead to achieve victory.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/8cc40e20d204320dbd6b347e989393b07e1d22a8/header.jpg?t=1788266449", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/047714f1c70e3ab574f5c71a517fd7a41f9c11a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788266449", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544140/047714f1c70e3ab574f5c71a517fd7a41f9c11a9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788266449", "web